  "auditor": "trapi:gpt-5.6-sol_2026-07-09",
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The baseline is an as-deposited FeNiCrCoCu thin-film coating on a conventional steel substrate without oxide pretreatment.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Annealing at 650 °C for 1 hour in low-partial-pressure oxygen will form an oxide scale on the FeNiCrCoCu coating.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The pre-oxidation treatment will produce a continuous oxide layer.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The pre-oxidation treatment will produce a nanostructured oxide layer.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The resulting layer is likely to be a spinel or mixed oxide.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxide layer will remain adherent under mechanical load.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "An intact surface oxide layer reduces direct contact between the sliding metallic bodies.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10730726::web::015::effect_of_control_functions_on_wear_rate"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The preformed oxide acts as a self-lubricating layer that lowers friction.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxide passivates the coating against further oxidation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preventing direct metallic contact will reduce adhesive wear.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10730726::web::015::effect_of_control_functions_on_wear_rate"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxide layer will reduce oxidative wear.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pre-oxidized coatings will display a distinct and uniform oxide layer in cross-sectional microscopy and EDS.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pre-oxidized coatings will have a significantly lower friction coefficient than as-deposited controls.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10730726::web::015::effect_of_control_functions_on_wear_rate"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pre-oxidized coatings will have a lower wear rate than as-deposited controls.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10730726::web::015::effect_of_control_functions_on_wear_rate"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed oxide-mediated mechanism applies from 600 to 800 °C under industrially relevant mechanical loads.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Improved wear resistance depends on producing an oxide scale with an optimal thickness.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10730726::web::015::effect_of_control_functions_on_wear_rate"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "An oxide scale exceeding a critical thickness will be susceptible to spallation.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Oxygen partial pressure and annealing duration can be adjusted to control oxide thickness.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
